# MyFarmAgents Platform — Project Context

## Repository scope (this workspace)

**This git repository is SmallFarmsAgents = OrganicMarketAgent (SFA) only.** Do not add commits for unrelated products (Famely Neusletter, TikTrack, agents-os). For cross-server handoff use `~/Documents/_agent_comm/`; for Neusletter/TikTrack source changes, the user must open the **correct project root** in the IDE. Canonical note: `documentation/external-references/CROSS_PROJECT_BOUNDARIES.md`.

## Language Policy (Enforced)

**ALL documents, code, comments, variable names, and inter-team communication
are written in English.** No Hebrew in documentation, code, or file names.

Hebrew is used only in direct conversation with project lead Nimrod.
**UI is full Hebrew RTL** — see `docs/RTL_DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md`.

Canonical terminology: `docs/GLOSSARY.md` — read it first.

Structured documentation hub for agents and operators: `documentation/README.md` (overview, schema, pipelines, CLI, troubleshooting, archive policy).

