## OrganicMarketAgent Architecture (locked)

- **Local Data Hub** runs Python pipeline: collect → parse → normalize → aggregate → publish
- **WordPress (nimrod.bio)** is presentation layer only — reads static artifacts
- **Client Hub:** `https://nimrod.bio/sfa-hub/` — status dashboard for milestones, tasks, open decisions
  - **Standard:** `docs/CLIENT_HUB_STANDARD_v1.md` (v1.1, 2026-04-09) — canonical for all Agents OS hubs (platform-agnostic)
  - Build: `python3 scripts/build_sfa_client_hub.py` → `hub/dist/`
  - Deploy: `python3 scripts/ftp_publish_sfa_client_hub.py` → `/sfa-hub/` on uPress
  - Ingest: `python3 scripts/ingest_sfa_feedback_json.py` → `hub/ssot/responses/`
  - Data: `hub/data/*.json` (roadmap, updates, tasks, decisions)
  - SSOT: `hub/ssot/` (manifest + responses)
  - Branding: "Agents OS @ nimrod.bio" + WhatsApp link on all hub pages
- No real-time connection between local system and public site
- No public API in V1
- **CSS Architecture (M8):** Three-layer system:
  - Layer 1: Flatsome parent + child theme (buttons, typography, grid)
  - Layer 2: `sfagent-base.css` in `flatsome-child/` (SFA shared tokens, components, utilities)
  - Layer 3: Inline `<style>` in each template (page-specific rules only)
  - Deploy: `scripts/wp_shortcode_install.py` handles CSS + PHP hooks via FTPS
  - Root CSS scope: `.sfagent`, shared prefix: `.sfa-*`
- **Hosting: uPress.co.il** (managed WordPress, shared Pro plan, server s887)
  - **Cross-project standard:** `docs/UPRESS_WORDPRESS_STANDARD_v2.md` (v2.0, 2026-04-08) — normative procedures for all uPress + WordPress projects
  - **Project-specific reference:** `docs/UPRESS_WORDPRESS_AGENT_PLAYBOOK.md` (v1.0, superseded — retained for nimrod.bio-specific details)
  - FTPS on port 21 (`ftp.s887.upress.link`), SSH/SFTP blocked
  - Built-in: SuperCache (server-level), CDN, SSL, daily backups, dev environments
  - **Caching: ezCache** (uPress native plugin, replaced WP Rocket)
  - **SEO: Yoast SEO** v27.3 (imported from AIOSEO, included in uPress premium library)
  - **Contact form:** Custom `[sfagent_contact_form]` shortcode in `functions.php` (zero-plugin)
  - **Accessibility:** WP Accessibility v2.3.3 (Joe Dolson) — focus outlines, form labels, tabindex fix, viewport fix, Hebrew labels via `wpa_labels` filter. Accessibility statement shortcode: `[sfagent_accessibility_statement]`
  - Premium plugins library available via uPress panel

