## Maintenance Commands

| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `python -m organic_market_agent catalog_renormalize` | Re-queue `unresolvable` → normalize → aggregate → publish |
| `python -m organic_market_agent full_data_refresh` | Community full refresh (reset normalized/unresolvable → re-run). Does NOT reset approved `ignored` rows. |
| `python -m organic_market_agent baseline_snapshot` | Write normalizer baseline JSON (`data/normalizer_baseline.json`) |
| `python -m organic_market_agent prune_raw_pipeline` | Prune old pipeline data (destructive) |

